      "content": "the summary is okay but feels a bit vague. can u go deeper into the arguments against them? i'm seeing a lot of people online saying that the whole opposition is just based on people being afraid of change or trying to protect their own interests rather than actually caring about the kids. is there any truth to that? like, is the opposition actually about the kids or just politics?",
